What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/battery_rm
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only remaining battery capacity reported by the active Oplus
		charger core, in the same units as `oplus_chg_chip.batt_rm`.
		ColorOS 14 power statistics consumes this path as
		`remaining_battery_power`.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/chip_soc
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only raw state of charge reported by the active Oplus charger
		core. This is the 9R `chip_soc` ABI consumed by the ColorOS 14 power
		statistics service.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/authenticate
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only battery authentication state from the active Oplus charger
		core. ColorOS 14's charger service consumes this 9R attribute.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/battery_cc
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only battery charge-cycle/coulomb counter value reported as
		`oplus_chg_chip.batt_cc` and consumed by power.stats and Midas.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/battery_fcc
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only full-charge-capacity value reported as
		`oplus_chg_chip.batt_fcc` and consumed by ColorOS power monitoring.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/battery_soh
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only battery state-of-health value reported as
		`oplus_chg_chip.batt_soh` and consumed by power.stats and Midas.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/fast_charge
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only VOOC fast-charge/logo state from the active Oplus charger
		core, matching the OnePlus 9R ColorOS 14 charger ABI.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/battery_notify_code
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only charger notification bit field reported as
		`oplus_chg_chip.notify_code`.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/sub_current
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only secondary-charger current. It reports zero on a
		single-charger device or when no platform-specific backend is present.

What:		/sys/class/oplus_chg/battery/charge_timeout
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only indication that charging exceeded the core's configured
		charging-time limit, reported as `oplus_chg_chip.chging_over_time`.
